00:20:19,630 --> 00:20:22,180
...لكن لم أستطع قول ذلك

217
00:20:22,890 --> 00:20:25,430
...لأنّني كنتُ خائفاً

218
00:20:43,860 --> 00:20:47,660
ironna mono wo shitte tomadotte

219
00:20:43,860 --> 00:20:47,660
I know different things,
I'm perplexed by them

220
00:20:47,780 --> 00:20:51,080
miageta sora wa

221
00:20:47,780 --> 00:20:51,080
And the sky I see above

222
00:20:51,750 --> 00:20:58,460
itsumo yori takaku kanjita
betsuni samishikuwa naiyo

223
00:20:51,750 --> 00:20:58,460
Feels higher than ever,
but I don't feel alone

224
00:20:58,710 --> 00:21:05,590
motto tsuyoku natte kimi wo mamoritai to

225
00:20:58,710 --> 00:21:05,590
I wanna get stronger, protect you

226
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:10,430
chiisaku itte waratta

227
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:10,430
I said it with a small voice and laughed

228
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:15,270
mada daijoubu na kiga shita

229
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:15,270
And I still felt all right

230
00:21:16,440 --> 00:21:21,280
Don't say good bye

231
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:24,450
kimi ja nakya dame nandayo

232
00:21:21,360 --> 00:21:24,450
You're the only one for me

233
00:21:24,530 --> 00:21:28,990
You say good bye

234
00:21:29,120 --> 00:21:32,120
tatoeba sonna toki mo

235
00:21:29,120 --> 00:21:32,120
Even if that may be

236
00:21:32,250 --> 00:21:36,960
boku ni totte

237
00:21:32,250 --> 00:21:36,960
You're the one

238
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:40,130
The one irreplaceable to me

239
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:40,130
kimi wa kakegaenai hito

240
00:21:40,210 --> 00:21:44,840
That promise between us

241
00:21:40,210 --> 00:21:44,840
bokura ga kawashita yakusoku wa

242
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:49,140
Will always be right here

243
00:21:44,970 --> 00:21:49,140
itsumo koko ni